  "lang": "te",
  "text": "1991 లో దేశాన్ని కాపాడటానికి gold బయటికి వెళ్ళింది... ఇప్పుడు దేశాన్ని రక్షించడానికి తిరిగి వస్తోంది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/d3fa8068f8c1.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 4, Oct 28 2026",
  "tag": "gold4"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Indian homes are sitting on about 25,000 tonnes of gold.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/aabe44cba477.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Now add up the top 10 central banks in the world. America, Germany, Italy, France, Russia, China, Switzerland, even our own RBI, Japan, the Netherlands... Indian homes still have more.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/66511ae78355.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "So why do Indians trust gold more than a bank? It's not just tradition. It's math.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/765fea192326.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Say you put 10,000 rupees into gold in 2006. Today, it's worth about 1.77 lakh. Nearly 18 times.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/86c19c170116.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "The same 10,000 in a bank FD, even at a steady 7 percent a year? About 38,000.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/6d330ad72429.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Here's the hidden reason. Gold has one price for the whole world. The rupee doesn't. In 2006, one dollar cost about 45 rupees. Today, about 95.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/1211ab081d0f.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "So when the rupee loses value... your gold doesn't. It quietly protects your savings.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/337dcb0f0b70.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "And when you need cash fast? Pledge your gold, and the loan comes in minutes, with very little paperwork.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/8e07845bef95.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "That's why gold loans are now India's second-biggest kind of retail loan, after home loans. About 16 lakh crore rupees.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/c7a8dc65b205.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "So the next time your mom, your sister, or your girlfriend buys gold... they're not wasting money.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/ef13109574c5.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "They're saving it. For the future.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/2d5e965efc88.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "మన ఇళ్ళల్లో దాదాపు ఇరవై ఐదు వేల టన్నుల gold ఉంది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/cc33018fbd5f.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "ఇప్పుడు ప్రపంచంలోని టాప్ పది central banks ని కలపండి. America, Germany, Italy, France, Russia, China, Switzerland, మన RBI కూడా, Japan, Netherlands... అయినా మన ఇళ్ళల్లోనే ఎక్కువ ఉంది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/faf0e3b2a256.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "మరి Indians కి bank కంటే gold మీదే ఎందుకు ఇంత నమ్మకం? ఇది సంప్రదాయం మాత్రమే కాదు. ఇది లెక్క.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/7c5cb27002f4.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "2006 లో మీరు పది వేల రూపాయల gold కొన్నారనుకోండి. ఇప్పుడు దాని విలువ దాదాపు ఒక లక్ష డెబ్బై ఏడు వేలు. దాదాపు పద్దెనిమిది రెట్లు.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/615b35d88248.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అదే పది వేలు bank FD లో, ఏడాదికి ఏడు శాతం చొప్పున పెరిగినా? దాదాపు ముప్పై ఎనిమిది వేలు మాత్రమే.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/132550918616.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అసలు రహస్యం ఇది. Gold కి ప్రపంచమంతా ఒకటే ధర. Rupee కి అలా కాదు. 2006 లో ఒక dollar దాదాపు నలభై ఐదు రూపాయలు. ఇప్పుడు దాదాపు తొంభై ఐదు.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/7d60bc220fd4.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అంటే rupee విలువ తగ్గినా... మీ gold విలువ తగ్గదు. మీ savings ని నిశ్శబ్దంగా కాపాడుతుంది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/f053085d9ac3.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "డబ్బు అర్జెంటుగా కావాలా? Gold తాకట్టు పెడితే, కొన్ని నిమిషాల్లో loan వస్తుంది, పెద్దగా paperwork లేకుండా.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/d34afd6a5554.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అందుకే ఇప్పుడు India లో home loans తర్వాత రెండో అతిపెద్ద retail loan, gold loan. దాదాపు పదహారు లక్షల కోట్ల రూపాయలు.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/aef11d0a33e0.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అందుకే మీ అమ్మ, మీ చెల్లి, లేదా మీ girlfriend gold కొంటే... వాళ్ళు డబ్బు వృథా చేయట్లేదు.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/48c6fcb341c3.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "భవిష్యత్తు కోసం దాచుకుంటున్నారు.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/db4bac089004.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 5, Oct 29 2026",
  "tag": "gold5"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "In January, gold hit about $5,590 an ounce. This week? It slipped below $4,000.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/1ee90bb39e94.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "That's almost 30 percent gone in nine months. So what happened to the \"safest\" thing you can own?",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/1cbdf892a5e8.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Reason one. Gold doesn't pay you anything. A bank FD pays interest. Gold just… sits there.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/b482fc0aa050.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "So when interest rates go up, gold looks less attractive. And in September, America's Fed raised rates for the first time since 2023.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/1a7598374485.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Reason two. Oil jumped on US-Iran tension. Oil up means prices up… and even more fear of rate hikes.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/595218e43cd3.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Reason three. When stock markets fall, big investors need cash, fast. And the easiest thing to sell? Gold.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/42dfc3260051.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "The fast money that rushed in back in January… is now rushing out.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/bc2bb9d6c83f.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "But here's what nobody's talking about. In September, central banks bought about 63 tonnes of gold. The most in almost two years.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/dd1e08936336.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "So the traders are selling… and the central banks are buying.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/9a70f332c3ea.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "And this isn't new. In 2011, gold set a record. It took nine years to beat it, in 2020.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/83c9687dd64c.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Still, since 2006, it's up about 17 times in rupees.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/9cfd06be3801.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Gold goes up and down like everything else. That's why people who hold it… think in years, not weeks.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/6620018c8e53.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "But gold still has a few secrets. Why is an Olympic gold medal… mostly silver? Andhra Pradesh just opened a new gold mine. So why does India still buy almost all its gold from abroad? And scientists actually turned lead into gold at CERN… so why can't we just make more? That's a why for another day. If you want it, comment below.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/6c53cdd284c7.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "That's a wrap on Gold week. All six videos, and the full story, are right here.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/69bf83151307.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "If you like learning things like this, we post a full video every Sunday and a new Short the other six days. So there's always something new.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/dd84f197b924.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "cta"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Subscribe, and we'll make it worth it.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/e84ee89ef316.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "cta"
 },
 {
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "Follow, and we'll make it worth it.",
  "file": "voice_lib/en/02467cb4ba05.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep English (grcC6bYJfJbBq5S549Id)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "cta"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "January లో gold ధర ఒక ounce కి దాదాపు 5,590 dollars కి చేరింది. ఈ వారం? 4,000 dollars కిందకి పడిపోయింది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/24064fa25ede.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "తొమ్మిది నెలల్లో దాదాపు 30 శాతం పోయింది. మరి అన్నిటికంటే safe అనుకునే gold కి ఏమైంది?",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/7974b02026eb.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "మొదటి కారణం. Gold మనకి ఏమీ interest ఇవ్వదు. Bank FD interest ఇస్తుంది. Gold అలా ఉంటుంది అంతే.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/55dd52561b0b.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "అందుకే interest rates పెరిగితే, gold మీద ఆసక్తి తగ్గుతుంది. September లో America Fed, 2023 తర్వాత మొదటిసారి rates పెంచింది.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/db37de5bb013.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "రెండో కారణం. America-Iran tension వల్ల oil ధర పెరిగింది. Oil పెరిగితే అన్ని ధరలు పెరుగుతాయి… rates ఇంకా పెంచుతారేమో అనే భయం.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/c44e59f8c31b.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "మూడో కారణం. Stock markets పడినప్పుడు, పెద్ద investors కి అర్జెంటుగా cash కావాలి. అమ్మడానికి అన్నిటికంటే easy? Gold.",
  "file": "voice_lib/te/201af187e741.mp3",
  "voice": "Sandeep Telugu (YudnU7tnCElqOrj11puE)",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "source": "Gold Short 6, Oct 30 2026",
  "tag": "gold6"
 },
 {
  "lang": "te",
  "text": "January లో వేగంగా వచ్చిన డబ్బు… ఇప్పుడు అంతే వేగంగా బయటికి వెళ్తోంది.",
